WORKING THESIS

--------------

"How does a person whose mind has been broken — by choice, by injury, by

circumstance — rebuild agency not through recovery of what was lost, but through

construction of what never existed?"

TITLE RATIONALE

---------------

The number Implies scale, obsession, survival — without explaining any of it

"ways to remember" Reframes 240+ tools as memory infrastructure, not productivity

No subtitle The title carries the full weight. Explanation weakens it.

Differentiation Centers the engineering response — not the medical/emotional journey

